   "period": "2026-06-30",
   "accession": "0002080126-26-000035",
   "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2080126/000208012626000035/fps-20260630.htm"
  },
  "description_short": "Forgent (NYSE: FPS) is a leading U.S. designer and manufacturer of electrical distribution equipment used in data centers, the power grid and energy-intensive industrial facilities. The Company specializes in manufacturing custom products that are 'engineered-to-order' for technically demanding applications. We believe Forgent is one of a small number of companies that can manufacture all of the electrical distribution equipment required for a data center or large manufacturing facility's powertrain with some of the highest levels of customization and shortest lead times available in the industry.",
